          "relation": "definition",
          "snippet": {
            "line": 467,
            "text": "noncomputable def activatedStress (h X0 : ℝ) (initial : HistoryRow → ℝ → ℝ)\n    (L U : Field) (T κ : ℝ) (p : Point) : ℝ × ℝ :=\n  (activatedAngular T κ L p * (activatedStockOne h X0 initial L U T κ p - actualP1 T κ L p),\n    activatedAngular T κ L p * (activatedStockTwo h X0 initial L U T κ p - actualP2 T κ X0 L U p))"
